6Z","updated_at":"2017-01-24T08:05:26Z","body":"I found the bug. It is in in `PostgresDriver` `disconnect` method:\r\n\r\n<https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/blob/b995b7ca2a09559b03cb301ecf3e0b9448bf4eb9/src/driver/postgres/PostgresDriver.ts#L169>\r\n\r\nThis is the offending conditional:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n            if (this.databaseConnectionPool) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen `usePool` is false, the value of this member variable during disconnect is `[]` (which makes sense). But in JavaScript the empty array evaluates to true. The fix is to change the conditional to:\r\n\r\n```typescript\r\n            if (this.pool) {\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/274735171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"benny-medflyt","id":24827547,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODI3NTQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24827547?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt","html_url":"https://github.com/benny-medflyt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benny-medflyt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/comments/2747